{%- comment -%}
  ActionWitness theme bridge (spec §12.12, FR-111).

  Render this as the FIRST thing inside <head> in `layout/theme.liquid`:

      {% render 'actionwitness-bridge' %}

  Position is not cosmetic. FR-111 requires the one-time pairing credential to
  be read out of the URL fragment and removed "before unrelated third-party
  theme scripts" run, and the only way to guarantee that is a *blocking classic
  script* ahead of every other tag on the page. `defer`, `async` and
  `type="module"` would each move this after the chat widget and the analytics
  tag, which is exactly the window the fragment must not be readable in.

  The two origins are set here, in the theme, rather than carried in the launch
  URL. The launch URL is a link — whoever composes one would otherwise choose
  where this store's cart observations are sent. Set them once, at install.

  Replace the placeholder below with your harness origin. Both must be exact
  HTTPS origins with no trailing slash and no path; the bridge refuses anything
  else and says so in the console.
{%- endcomment -%}

<script
  src="{{ 'actionwitness-bridge.js' | asset_url }}"
  data-actionwitness
  data-harness-origin="https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-HARNESS.example"
  data-store-origin="https://{{ shop.permanent_domain }}"
></script>
